  note = {A practitioner guide from Inoculation Science explaining prebunking as a proactive strategy to build preemptive resilience to misinformation. Grounded in inoculation theory, it describes how exposing people to weakened forms of manipulative content can help them develop resistance before they encounter it in the wild},
}

